  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Are you ready to bring your dream home to life? This expansive 2500 sqm (approximately) land, nestled in the highly sought-after Okura River Rd, stands as the final available site in a distinguished community of premium lifestyle properties. Positioned at an elevated vantage point, it boasts serene rural views that offer a tranquil ambiance.\r\n\r\nLong Bay, renowned for its coastal allure, stands as one of the most coveted new suburbs. With the stunning Long Bay Beach and the expansive Long Bay Regional Park right at your doorstep, this location promises an idyllic coastal living experience. Education is covered with zoning for Decile 10 local schools: Long Bay Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Conveniently located near Albany Shopping Centre and providing easy access to motorways, this property is perfectly situated.\r\n\r\nOur vendor is resolute in their decision to sell! Seize this final opportunity to secure a rare and extraordinary piece of real estate!",
